;; The inference variables, their bounds and incorporation, the graph solver, the inference context
;; and instantiateMethod reimplement, for the native types, jdk26u
;; (https://github.com/openjdk/jdk26u at baf63fbe42b8758448fee570a9d9bb914272d259)'s
;; src/jdk.compiler/share/classes/com/sun/tools/javac/comp/Infer.java (instantiateMethod,
;; PartiallyInferredMethodType.check, generateReturnConstraints, needsEagerInstantiation,
;; generateReferenceToTargetConstraint, instantiateAsUninferredVars, the incorporation actions
;; CheckBounds, CheckInst, SubstBounds, CheckUpperBounds, PropagateBounds and the incorporation
;; engine, doIncorporation and its cache, getParameterizedSupers, the inference steps, the graph
;; solver with its inference graph, LeafSolver and BestLeafSolver), comp/InferenceContext.java
;; (asUndetVar, asInstType, free, restvars, save, rollback, dupTo, min with its ReachabilityVisitor,
;; solve, solveAny, solveBasic, the free type listeners), code/Type.java (UndetVar: its bounds,
;; addBound, substBounds, dup, setInst), code/Types.java (isSubtype, isSuperType, isSameType,
;; containsType, containedBy, isSubtypeUnchecked, isConvertible, asSuper, supertype, interfaces,
;; closure, insert, union, intersect, merge, closureMin, compoundMin, lub, erasedSupertypes, glb,
;; glbFlattened, rank, getBounds, newInstances, wildUpperBound, wildLowerBound, cvarUpperBound,
;; cvarLowerBound), code/Symbol.java (TypeSymbol.precedes) and util/GraphUtils.java (tarjan),
;; whose notice follows (LICENSE.md, "OpenJDK (jdk26u)"):
